# Dashboard

`dashboard/app.py` reads Delta with delta-rs. It does not start a Spark session.
Data root is `HVACPULSE_DATA_ROOT` (default `.local/`), same as the jobs.

```powershell
uv sync --group dev --group dashboard
.\scripts\local\run_local_stack.ps1 -Task dashboard
uv run --group dashboard pytest tests/dashboard -m dashboard
```

Plant charts live in `dashboard/plant_view.py`.
